        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ఎంపిక",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎంపిక — empika — \"a choice; a selection\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ ఉద్యోగానికి ఆమెను తీసుకోవడం మంచి ఎంపిక. ā udyōgāniki āmenu tīsukōvaḍaṁ mañci empika. Taking her on for that job was a good choice."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎంపిక (empika) చేయు, to select; ఎంపికైన, selected."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎంపిక (empika) is a Telugu noun whose origin is not settled; DEDR does not list it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
