          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ప్రత్యామ్నాయం (pratyāmnāyaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit pratyāmnāya, a term of logic for \"the proposition restated\" (Monier-Williams); the Telugu sense \"an alternative\" is modern."
            }
          ]
